<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: vegetable milk extractor -->
  <VCE_VegMilkExtractor.label>植物乳提取機</VCE_VegMilkExtractor.label>
  <!-- EN: A small work station containing a presser and an industrial decanter centrifuge to separate vegetable extract from mash. The high G-forces generated by the decanter centrifuge allow you to extract vegetable milk from rice, almonds, coconuts, oats and soybeans. -->
  <VCE_VegMilkExtractor.description>一個小型機器，內涵一個壓縮機來搗碎植物和一個工業臥螺離心機用來提取營養物質。離心機產生的大量離心力讓你能從稻米，杏仁，椰子，燕麥和大豆中提取植物乳。</VCE_VegMilkExtractor.description>
  
</LanguageData>